{%- doc -%}
  Opens connections to the third-party hosts this theme is guaranteed to hit, before the
  markup that needs them is parsed.

  The GoHighLevel chat bubble loads on every page from `snippets/chat-widget.liquid`, so
  its host is always worth a preconnect: the handshake (DNS + TCP + TLS) is the expensive
  part, and doing it early keeps it off the critical path.

  The form hosts get a cheaper `dns-prefetch` instead. They are only needed on the
  templates that embed a contact form, so resolving DNS ahead of time helps there without
  spending a full connection on pages that never use them.

  Rendered from `snippets/scripts.liquid`, which `layout/theme.liquid` renders in <head>.

  @example
  {% render 'resource-hints' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- comment -%}
  RemoteAsset is disabled below: it fires on any external host, but a connection hint is
  not an asset. These hosts cannot be moved to Shopify's CDN — opening the connection
  early is the whole point of the tags.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% # theme-check-disable RemoteAsset %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com">

<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://link.msgsndr.com">
<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com">
{% # theme-check-enable RemoteAsset %}
